# Gentleman Guardian Angel — project configuration.
#
# This submodule is its own repository with its own reviewer run, so it needs its own
# config; without one `gga` falls back to the global defaults.
#
# FILE_PATTERNS: the global default is `*.ts,*.tsx,*.js,*.jsx,*.py,*.go` — which in an
# Astro project means the pages are never looked at. Most of the code here lives in
# `.astro` files: the markup, the inline page scripts, and every piece of copy. A review
# that skips them reports success having read the glue and none of the product.
#
# The parent repository makes the same correction for `.rs`, and records why: "No matching
# files staged" reads like approval and is not.
PROVIDER="claude"
FILE_PATTERNS="*.ts,*.tsx,*.js,*.jsx,*.astro,*.mjs"
EXCLUDE_PATTERNS="*.test.ts,*.spec.ts,*.test.tsx,*.spec.tsx,*.d.ts,dist/*,node_modules/*"
RULES_FILE="AGENTS.md"
STRICT_MODE="true"
TIMEOUT="300"
